* From C. L. Baker, "JOSS: Scenario of a Filmed Report", RAND RM-4162-PR, June 1964: the film of 21 March 1964, pages 2 to 4. JOSS as a desk calculator.
! joss 1964
Type 2+2.
Type 2+2-3-3+4+4.
Type -1.2·1.2.
Type 7/2.
Type 7/0.
Type 2*8.
Type 3+2,3-2,3·2,_,3/2,3*2.
Type [.7*5-2.3*(-.7)]/[7*6-|9*5-5*7|*(2/3)].
Type sqrt(49).
Type sqrt(sqrt(sqrt(sqrt(3*2*2*2*2)))).
Type cos (3.14159265/4).
Type log(2.71828183).
Type y.
Set y = exp(10).
Type y.
Type y, ip(y), fp(y), dp(y), xp(y).
